{"id":"vod_sn_36961","vodId":"36961","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"尸姬 玄","name_cn":"尸姬 玄","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/19bc5d767854c92f47f5aa69fdaa5c48.jpg"},"summary":"一场意外中，星村真姬那（秋山奈奈 配音）一家人全都死在了神秘组织“七星”的手下。和尚田神景世（藤原启治 配音）找到了真姬那的遗体，利用秘术将其复活，成为了拥有超越常人的力量的尸姬。身为尸姬，真姬那的敌人是她的同类“尸”，当斩杀了108名敌人之后，真姬那便可获得转生成佛的资格。　　神田死后，他的养子花神旺里（羽染达也 配音）继承了神田和真姬那之间的契约，之后，外表可爱内心成熟的天瀬早季（菊地美香 配音）、温柔可人的山神异月（中村知世 配音）和成熟冷静的远冈明（悠木碧 配音）等尸姬亦接二连三出现在了花神旺里的身边，而他们共同的敌人“七星”则再一次地开始了活动。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n2AmA1ZN0Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6UDfCvqZtR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ButsTiu03b1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uhCF7sREKN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9LQrdtCFMG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pfP5kucz6S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vrQpW2giiC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gz3LY0U7sD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JK8ib6tHbY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HxrA9mZCEY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/08TvvWTWDn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ACr37JJDEv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JG26VyisKs1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:16.883Z"}